# The build context is open_edition/; the workspace image needs only the agent's package, the plugin it gives each
# claude start (core_plugin/), the approval hook it gives the sessions (ade_hook.py: one file, standard
# library only) and this directory, so nothing of the app (its accounts, its signing code) is sent to the builder or
# can reach the image.
*
!proofpane_workspace
!core_plugin
!ade_hook.py
!workspace_image
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
